Array read by rows in which n-th row lists orders of elements of Symm(n) that are not orders of elements of Symm(n-1) (6th row is empty, written as 0 by convention).

The 69 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

